@startuml sequence_route
title Route Sequence (Moderate)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam arrowColor #555555
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam legendBorderColor #B8C2CC

actor User
participant App
participant useMapbox
participant pathNetwork

User -> App : select Start POI
User -> App : select End POI
App -> pathNetwork : computeCampusRoute(start,end, opts)
pathNetwork --> App : RouteResult
App -> useMapbox : drawRoute(path)
useMapbox --> App : (rendered)
App -> User : show distance + ETA

note over App,pathNetwork Client-side route with constraints end note
legend bottom 1 Start 2 End 3 Compute 4 Draw 5 Show ETA end legend

@enduml
